{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-ii", "title": "滕文公下", "description": "陳代曰：「不見諸侯，宜若小然；今一見之，大則以王，小則以霸。且志曰：『枉尺而直尋』，宜若可為也。」\n孟子曰：「昔齊景公田，招虞人以旌，不至，將殺之。志士不忘在溝壑，勇士不忘喪其元。孔子奚取焉？取非其招不往也，如不待其招而往，何哉？且夫枉尺而直尋者，以利言也。如以利，則枉尋直尺而利，亦可為與？昔者趙簡子使王良與嬖奚乘，終", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "丈夫", "id": "丈夫"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "室", "id": "室"}, {"form": "害", "id": "害"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "獸", "id": "獸"}, {"form": "率", "id": "率"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "祿", "id": "祿"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}, {"form": "饋", "id": "饋"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.06746535063312, "source": "率", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.816150922352214, "source": "率", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.607910391580269, "source": "率", "target": "獸"}, {"weight": 1.6620002425249558, "source": "率", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 2.9147632110203237, "source": "率", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.2216160304603783, "source": "率", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.1660776393012298, "source": "祿", "target": "兄"}, {"weight": 2.627081138568543, "source": "祿", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.4298565612323235, "source": "居", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.627081138568543, "source": "居", "target": "室"}, {"weight": 1.374318170073175, "source": "居", "target": "兄"}, {"weight": 0.5633879538568461, "source": "人", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 1.123003741792269, "source": "人", "target": "害"}, {"weight": 2.2216160304603783, "source": "人", "target": "獸"}, {"weight": 1.123003741792269, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.4298565612323235, "source": "人", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.3202283191284883, "source": "仁", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.9147632110203237, "source": "仁", "target": "獸"}, {"weight": 0.9688530619650105, "source": "仁